Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How'd someone get your credit card number?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么会有人知道 你的信用卡号码
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no idea. Look how much they spent!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:06.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不知道 看看他们花了多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:10.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Calm down. You only have to pay for the stuff you bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:10.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，冷静点，信用卡公司说 你只要付你有买东西的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still, it's just such reckless spending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这真的是挥霍无度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When somebody steals your credit card...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想他们偷你的信用卡时…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they've kind of already thrown caution to the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早就将王法抛诸脑后了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, what a geek. They spent $69.95 on a Wonder Mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，真是怪人 花了美金69点95元买神奇拖把
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我买的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! Oh, the yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，嗯心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's doing it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:39.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcel, stop humping the lamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:39.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔，别再侵犯那盏灯了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop humping! Now, Marcel, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要这样 马塞尔，回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come here, Marcel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来这里，．马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no! Not in my room! I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要！别去我房间！ 我去抓他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:48.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've got to do something about the humping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:48.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，你得想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? It's just a phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？只是阶段性而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's what we said about Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们也是那样说乔伊的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:59.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, would you all relax? It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:59.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放轻松点好吗  没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Marcel, stop it! Marcel! Bad monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:02.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔，给我停止！ 马塞尔！你这个坏猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? RACHEL: Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's just say my Curious George doll is no longer curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就说我的好奇娃娃 已经不再好奇了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E21: The One with the Fake Monica
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》 第一季 第21集：盗刷信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.15,0:01:25.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.11,0:01:29.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:33.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:40.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:44.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:02.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh, Monica, you are not still going over that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:02.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡 你不会还在 看那个东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- This woman's living my life. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这个女人过着我的生活 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:09.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's living my life, and she's doing it better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:09.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在过我的生活 而且过得比我好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at this. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看看这个，看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She buys tickets to plays I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她买票去看我想看的戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She shops at stores that I'm intimidated by the salespeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她买的衣服 是我早就想买的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:20.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：亚当·却斯  艾拉·安德里德）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She spent $300 on art supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她花三百美金在美术用品上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又不是艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, I might be if I had the supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我有那些东西 或许就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I could do all this stuff. Only I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些我都可以做啊 只是我都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:31.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：盖尔曼库索）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:34.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Monica, come on. You do cool things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.05,0:02:34.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，别这样 你也做很多很棒的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, really? Let's compare, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  来比较一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:40.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's so late for "shall we?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:40.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在做比较 会不会太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I go horseback riding in the park, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会去公园骑马吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I take classes at The New School?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会在新学院大学上课吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不会 - 不会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's got everything I want, and she doesn't have my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有所有我要的东西 而且不用应付我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about Joey Paponi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊·帕帕尼如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, still too ethnic. My agent thinks I should have a name that's more neutral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行，太有种族意味了 我的经纪人觉得要取中立一点的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey Switzerland?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊·瑞士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus I think it should be Joe. Joey makes me sound like I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我觉得叫乔就好  乔伊听起来好像我只有…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么大而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我并不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joe, Joe, Joe... Stalin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔、乔、乔… 史达林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史达林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I know that name? That sounds familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听过那个名字吗  好耳熟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, it does not ring a bell with me. - Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没印象
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:41.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joe Stalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:41.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔·史达林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, that's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might want to try Joseph. - Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还可以试试乔瑟夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:57.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joseph Stalin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:57.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔瑟夫·史达林！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I think you'd remember that! - Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 大家一定会记得！ - 当然啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye Bye Birdie, starring Joseph Stalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《别了，鸟儿》 由乔瑟夫·史达林主演
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:08.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joseph Stalin is the Fiddler on the Roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:08.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔瑟夫·史达林是 《屋顶上的提琴手》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Uh, yes, this is Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是摩妮卡·盖勒 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:28.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, I'm taking classes with you, and I was wondering what they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:28.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在你们那边上课 我想知道是什么课程
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:32.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to tap class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去上踢踏舞课了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:41.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you can dance with the woman that stole your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:41.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好让你跟偷了你信用卡的女人 一起跳舞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's got my life. I want to see who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她偷了我的人生 我想知道她是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go to the post office! I'm sure her picture's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:46.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就去邮局啊！ 我相信里面有张贴她的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:50.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, you're kind of losing it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:50.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的，你快失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is really becoming a weird obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这已经变成怪异的执迷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is madness, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太疯狂了  我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For the love of God, Monica, don't do it!
