Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们自己的私自执法方式
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane? This woman stole from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗  这个女人偷了你的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She stole! She's a stealer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她偷东西，是小偷耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:20.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After you're with this woman for 10 minutes, you forget all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:20.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟她相处十分钟之后 你就会忘掉这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, she's this astounding person...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的是个奇女子…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with this amazing spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}振奋人心！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, which she probably stole from some cheerleader!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊，可能是从啦啦队员 那里偷来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Take off their hats. - Popes in a Volkswagen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 把帽子脱掉 - 福斯车里的教宗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:36.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:36.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯哼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love that joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我超爱那个笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:49.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No way! No way did you do this! - Monana was very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:49.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不可能！你不可能这么做！ - 摩娜娜很勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:51.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was so wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:51.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超狂野的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:54.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We told them we were the Gunnersons in room 615...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:54.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们跟他们说我们是 615号房的刚氏姐妹…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:58.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...only to find out the Boston Celtics had the entire sixth floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:58.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才知道波士顿的《塞尔蒂克队》 包下整个六楼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So when they caught on to the fact that we're short and have breasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当他们发现 我们很矮而且有胸部后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:06.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They threw us out. I was thrown out of a hotel! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:06.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就把我们轰出去 我被饭店赶出去，我耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go, Monana!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好样的，摩娜娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:14.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you ladies are not the only ones living the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:14.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是只有你们活在梦想中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get to go pour coffee for people I don't know. Don't wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得去为我不认识的人 倒咖啡了，不用等我了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，还有一件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...tomorrow we're auditioning for a Broadway show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们明天要去参加 百老汇的试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's an open call for Cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《猫》剧有一个缺额
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm thinking we go down there, sing "Memories"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说我们可以去 演唱《回忆》…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:36.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and make complete fools of ourselves. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:36.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把自己当成傻子 你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.34,0:11:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不、不、不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember who you're dealing with here. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要记得我是什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not like you. I can't even stand in front of a tap class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不像你，我连站在 踢踏舞教室前面都有困难
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's because of your Amish background.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那大概是因为你有孟诺教派的背景
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Well, you're Pennsylvania Dutch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么  - 你是宾州的荷兰人 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:57.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Till I bought a blow dryer. Then I was shunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:57.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到我买了吹风机 就被逐出村里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以前就跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:05.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then one day, I saw a movie that changed my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:05.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后有一天，我看了一部 改变我一生的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did you ever see Dead Poets Society? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有看过《春风化雨》吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought that movie was so incredibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得那部电影超级…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无聊的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, that thing at the end where the kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后那个孩子自杀…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...kills himself because he can't be in the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只因为不能参与话剧演出
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like, "Kid, wait a year. Leave home, do some community theater!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，等个一年 离家参与社区话团演出不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I walked out of there, and I thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我走出戏院后心想…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Now, that's two hours of my life that I'm never getting back!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我浪费了永远拿不回来的 两小时生命〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that scared me more than all the other crap I was afraid to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个想法震撼了我 让我及时行乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I would definitely not recommend Mrs. Doubtfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我绝对不推荐你看 《窈窕奶爸》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:56.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We didn't get into Scranton.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:56.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们进不了斯克兰顿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was our safety zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我们的保障动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They take, like, dogs and cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们连狗和牛都收
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:08.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:08.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:12.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know who this is harder on, me or him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:12.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂是我还是他 比较难受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:15.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd say that chair's taking the brunt of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:15.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想是那张椅子最难受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:19.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: Marcel. Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:19.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔，马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcel, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔，不要弄了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? How can nobody want him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到了吗  怎么可能没人要他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:28.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:28.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会有人要的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know there already is a Joseph Stalin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道 已经有位乔瑟夫史达林了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在开玩笑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:46.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, he was this Russian dictator who slaughtered all these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:46.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然他是个俄国独裁者 屠杀过很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You'd think you would've known that! - You'd think I would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你会想说这种事情应该要知道的！ - 你会想说我该知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, what do you think a good stage name for me would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你觉得什么艺名 适合我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Flame Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火焰男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where exactly is your zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的动物园在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's technically not a zoo per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}严格来说，它不能算是动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's, uh, more of an interactive wildlife experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它比较像是互动的野生体验
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me ask you some questions about... Is it, uh, Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我问问你几个问题 他叫做马塞尔对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yes. - Yes. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:22.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does he, uh, fight with other animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会和其他动物打架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. He's very docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会，他非常温驯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:30.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm. Even if he were cornered?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:30.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使被逼到角落去也一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't know. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯，我不太清楚 为什么问？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, how is he at handling small objects?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他掌控小东西的能力为何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He can hold a banana, if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可以握住香蕉 如果你是这个意思的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about a hammer or a small blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}铁槌或小刀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would he need a blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他为什么会需要小刀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:57.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he's up against a jungle cat or an animal with horns...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:57.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他得面对猎豹 或有角的动物…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you got to give the little guy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总得给他点东西 自我防卫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Otherwise, it's just cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然就太残忍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He got into San Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他能去圣地牙哥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were coming back from our walk, and the phone was ringing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们散步回来后 电话响起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He's in! - He's in? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他进了  - 他进了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.93,0:15:15.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you hear that, Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.93,0:15:15.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有听到吗  马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}San Diego! San Diego! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是圣地牙哥耶  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:22.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're making a mistake. San Diego's well and good...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:22.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的犯下大错 圣地牙哥的环境是很不错…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:25.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but if you give him to me, I'll start him against a blind rabbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:25.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果你把他交给我 我会训练他对抗瞎眼的兔子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and give you 20 percent of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还给你百分之二十的门票收入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yo-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哟嗬！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:53.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica and I just crashed an embassy party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:53.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡和我跑去 大使馆派对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:55.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:55.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喝醉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am so drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我超醉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. Great. You know what? You could have called.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了，你该打通电话回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been up here. I've been worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在家里担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:13.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:13.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Water rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}水超棒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The restaurant called. They want to know if you're showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}餐厅今天又打来了 他们想知道你会不会去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to the Big Apple Circus today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天要去看大苹果马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:39.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing? You're gonna lose your job. This is not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:39.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在干嘛？你会失去你的工作 这一点都不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:41.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:41.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，这正是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not just the person who needs to fluff the pillows...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.23,0:16:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不只是那种必须拍松枕头…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:46.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and pay the bills as soon as they come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:46.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帐单一来就立刻缴钱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:51.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, when I'm with her, I'm so much more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:51.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟她在一起时 就不再是那样的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:53.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:53.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:57.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Monana!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:57.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是摩娜娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:04.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahem, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:04.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, she is. Hold on a second, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在，请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahem, Monana, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩娜娜，找你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:12.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The credit card people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:12.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}信用卡公司打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:26.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They've arrested Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们逮捕摩妮卡了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（纽约市矫正署）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:41.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:43.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:43.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not too bad. Fortunately, blue's my color.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还可以 幸好我喜欢蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道我在这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是摩妮卡盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was my credit card you were using.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你之前用的是我的信用卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That I was not expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这点我完全没料到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:04.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to know, I didn't turn you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:04.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想让你知道 报案的人不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:09.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Thanks. - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:09.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谢了 - 不，我才要谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have given me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你带给我太多东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:14.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it wasn't for you, I'd never have gotten...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:14.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果不是你 我永远无法…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:16.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to sing "Memories" at the Winter Garden Theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:16.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在冬花园剧院演唱《回忆》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, you only got to sing "Memo..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实你只开口唱了〝回〞而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you're in here. What am I gonna do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信你在这里 没有你我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:28.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's gonna crash the embassy parties with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:28.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会跟我混进大使馆宴会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's gonna take me to the Big Apple Circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要带我去看大苹果马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, I started my day by peeing in front of 25 other women...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，我每天早上都得 在二十五个人面前尿尿…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:40.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you're worried about who will take you to the Big Apple Circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:40.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你却担心 谁要带你去看大苹果马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:45.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, not worried, you know, just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不是担心 我只是纳闷而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing to wonder about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么好纳闷的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll go back to being who you were because that's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就回去过以前的生活 因为那才是真正的你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Not necessarily. - Yes, necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:54.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 也不尽然 - 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what it is. Maybe it's the Amish thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道是为什么 或许和你是孟诺教派的人有关
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, I'm not actually Amish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我其实不是孟诺教派的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Then why are you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  那你为何那么像
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:24.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You by the door, in or out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:24.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}站在门边的那个 要不要加入
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You in the back, you're getting it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后面的那个，你全都跳错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least I'm doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我有在即目
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:55.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}WOMAN [OVER PA]: This is the final boarding call for Flight 67 to San Diego...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:55.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是飞往圣地牙哥 67航班的最后登机通知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...boarding at Gate 42A.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}登机门为42A
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, goodbye, little monkey guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，再见了，小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:04.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I wrote you this poem. - Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:04.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我替你写了一首诗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, but don't eat it till you get on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是上了飞机才能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:10.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Thank you, Aunt Phoebe. - Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:10.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你，菲比阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:15.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, bye, champ.
